{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個別握手会の服"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のメイクは......\nめっちゃナチュラルメイクだったんだぁー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マスカラとリップぐらいしかしてなかったんだよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今日もいろんな所から、逢いにきてくれて本当にありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山の元気をもらいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はパワーを皆様に充電出来たかな〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、これないけど応援してくださってた皆様のパワーも感じていました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋個別握手会の待ち時間中\nなんとなく昔のblogを読み返したまあやです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初期のblogは目がチカチカするとのご意見もあり、文字を黒にしたことを思い出しました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初はコメント数『６』とかだったんだよ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会だって始めての時は\n一人だったな〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバー同士最初は敬語だったんだよ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも時間がたつにつれてタメ口になっちゃったけど..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかこうして考えると\n凄いきつい上り坂だけど、\n凄い自分の力にもなったし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張って良かったなぁ\nって思わせてもらった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆様に本当に感謝！感謝です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ坂道は頂点までほど遠いけど、\n今までやって来たこと、\n１つも無駄なことはなかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結果がともなわなかったとしても、\n自分の力の大きな大きな糧となったよ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日ね握手会で心がジワッってきたことがあってね......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『見てる人はみてるから』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言われたんだっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"凄く心を打たれました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見てくれてる人は見てくれてんだなぁ......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一人一人を大事に、ちゃんと素直に感謝の気持ちをつたえなきゃっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかいろんなことを考えれた言葉でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日来てくださった一人一人を思い出して"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆からのコメントを読み返して"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやは又明日から\n頑張ります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガッツで、頑張りまあや〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもいろんな試練があると思うけど...きっと皆様だって学校や仕事やバイト...いろんな所で頑張ってるから"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心は一緒ですよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやも一緒に頑張らせてね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう思ったら強くなれるんだ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"齊藤ちはるんに見つめられ固まるイケメン"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イヤ！\n今日は\n可愛い生駒っち"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"通称こまちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"←はい！勝手にそう呼んでいるだけです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この写真の駒まちゃんは固まりながら変顔してるらしいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"駒ちゃんが言ってた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二人はまあやの隣でふざけてたよ\n握手会の休憩中......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はカメラマンをして沢山写真撮りました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛いんだもん......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑笑笑"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の質問の返事は..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前髪分けたほうがいいよ♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って方が少し多かったですね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の私服はどうでしたかぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1725011/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"}],"source":"archive"}